{"id":"f07e41c114d4b890","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model.md","title":"ω阶段的最小Horn模型","display":"thm-definite-least-herbrand-model — ω阶段的最小Horn模型","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model","aliases":["72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model"],"display":"thm-definite-least-herbrand-model — ω阶段的最小Horn模型","depends_on":["[[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]","[[72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity]]","[[72-thm-kleene-fixed-point]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local positive Horn model theorem; contrasted with Ch.IX Example3.3.2 print653/PDF665","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-definite-least-herbrand-model — ω阶段的最小Horn模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3a4858795b9c601\" href=\"?note=f3a4858795b9c601\" title=\"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator\">72-df-definite-herbrand-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3d353f164230c6a\" href=\"?note=c3d353f164230c6a\" title=\"72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity\">72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"48f27dd0a6718192\" href=\"?note=48f27dd0a6718192\" title=\"72-thm-kleene-fixed-point\">72-thm-kleene-fixed-point</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local positive Horn model theorem; contrasted with Ch.IX Example3.3.2 print653/PDF665"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,T_P,\\operatorname{HModel}_P\">\\(P,\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,T_P,\\operatorname{HModel}_P\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3a4858795b9c601\" href=\"?note=f3a4858795b9c601\" title=\"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator\">72-df-definite-herbrand-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_n,I_\\omega\">\\(I_n,I_\\omega\\)</span> 在下式按自然数递归及并定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_0:=\\varnothing,\\qquad I_{n+1}:=T_P(I_n),\\qquad I_\\omega:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}I_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_0:=\\varnothing,\\qquad I_{n+1}:=T_P(I_n),\\qquad I_\\omega:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}I_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad&amp;I_n\\subseteq I_{n+1},\\\\\nT_P(I_\\omega)&amp;=I_\\omega,\\\\\n\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I_\\omega)&amp;,\\qquad\nI_\\omega=\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)\\},\\\\\nA\\in I_\\omega&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)\\Rightarrow A\\in I)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad&amp;I_n\\subseteq I_{n+1},\\\\\nT_P(I_\\omega)&amp;=I_\\omega,\\\\\n\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I_\\omega)&amp;,\\qquad\nI_\\omega=\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)\\},\\\\\nA\\in I_\\omega&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)\\Rightarrow A\\in I)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从空集出发的首步递增，单调性归纳给所有相邻包含。上一连续性定理和Kleene论证给ω并为不动点。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是任意模型，则它是前不动点，自然数归纳给每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_n\\subseteq I\">\\(I_n\\subseteq I\\)</span>；取并得最小性。模型族非空，因为整个Herbrand基是模型；最小点本身也在族中，故交集恰为该点。最后的原子等价只是在Herbrand模型范围内的正原子结论。四值envelope还追踪负证据，不能据本条把其闭包序数压到ω。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator","status":"resolved","id":"f3a4858795b9c601","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"c3d353f164230c6a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-definite-herbrand-continuity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-kleene-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"48f27dd0a6718192","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-kleene-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator","status":"resolved"